      "content": "that looks good, thanks. could you add a line mentioning that we've been noticing some odd inconsistencies in our inventory lately too? like, items missing from shipments that were definitely signed for on the manifest. just to show them that this isn't an isolated thing with just this one invoice. keep it professional though, nothing too accusatory.",
